  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5601.18 “Transfer” or “transferred” means the provision by an authorized requestor pursuant to RSA 260:14 of any motor vehicle record information to any other person. “",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5601.18 “Transfer” or “transferred” means the provision by an authorized requestor pursuant to RSA 260:14 of any motor vehicle record information to any other person. “Transfer” or “transferred” does not include the provision of information from an agent to his or her principal, where such exchange is specifically authorized by law.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by EXEMPT, #7621, eff 1-1-02",
